<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 226 ALL OUT V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 226 ALL OUT V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were all out for 226 in</p>
<p>49.4 overs after being put in to bat in their 50 overs against</p>
<p>India in the fourth limited overs match of the Singer world</p>
<p>series tournament on Sunday.</p>
</text>
